# 经典系统动力学原型：种群逻辑斯蒂增长（Logistic Growth，教科书公有领域模型）
graph "种群逻辑斯蒂"

var population "种群规模"
var births "出生数"
var deaths "死亡数"
var rpc "人均资源"

population -> + births @loops R1
births -> + population @loops R1,R2
population -> + deaths @loops B1
deaths -> - population @loops B1
population -> - rpc @loops R2
rpc -> - births @loops R2

loop R1 "出生增长回路" "R" [population, births]
loop B1 "死亡平衡回路" "B" [population, deaths]
loop R2 "资源约束回路" "R" [population, rpc, births]
